  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-resume",
      "text": "[English](README.en.md)\n\n把 Codex、Claude Code、Cursor、Grok、Pi、Qoder、WorkBuddy、ZCode 的本机会话整理成可继续工作的上下文，在 DeepSeek Harness 中接着做。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "**0.2.8 面向 DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.5。** 安装包和仓库均包含编译好的插件，无需下载 Harness 源码或自行构建。读取历史需要本机有 Python 3；读取压缩的 Codex rollout 另需 `zstd`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "官方桌面端",
      "text": "1. 打开 **插件 → 添加插件**（部分版本入口在设置里）。\n2. 在 **包名或地址** 中填入 `github:aa2246740/dsh-resume#v0.2.8`，然后安装并启用。\n3. 按安装器提示完成激活，在输入框输入 `/resume-`，确认能看到下面列出的八条命令。\n\n也可以在 [v0.2.8 Release](https://github.com/aa2246740/dsh-resume/releases/tag/v0.2.8) 下载 `dsh-resume-0.2.8.tgz`，把该文件的绝对路径填入同一安装框。桌面端使用自己的 desktop profile，无需运行 Web Host 命令。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Web Host",
      "text": "使用官方 CLI：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:aa2246740/dsh-resume#v0.2.8\n```\n\n或在下载的安装包所在目录运行：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-resume-0.2.8.tgz\n```\n\n需要官方 `dsh` 和 pnpm 可用，Node.js 版本为 `^22.19.0` 或 `>=24.0.0`。使用与现有 Web Host 相同的 `DSH_HOME`；这条命令只安装到 Web profile，不会替桌面端安装。按官方安装器返回的提示完成激活；只有它要求重启时，再正常退出并重开原来的 Host，不要启动第二个 Host。\n\n也可以从 npm 安装 `@aa2246740/dsh-resume`。npm 包与 GitHub 包提供同一个插件，选择其中一种安装，不要同时安装两份。"
    },
    {
      "section": "升级与卸载",
      "text": "升级时重复对应安装步骤即可。若从旧版手动挂载方式迁移，停用旧的重复挂载行，只保留包自带的 `dsh-resume` 实例。\n\n桌面端通过插件管理器卸载。Web Host 使用：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-resume\n```\n\n如果安装的是 npm 包，把上面的包名换成 `@aa2246740/dsh-resume`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "输入 `/resume-claude`，另外七条同理。它只读本机那次会话，抽出还能接手的上下文，写成一张交接卡。旧进程不会被拉起来，别人的会话文件也不会被改。\n\n六段按目标、文件、做到哪、还差什么、停在哪、读者警告来写。标题对不上号时不会猜，会列出候选让你挑。"
    },
    {
      "section": "命令",
      "text": "只读，不改任何一家的会话仓库。系统提示、隐藏推理、加密或坏掉的记录要么丢掉，要么标明不可用。历史里的结论先标成 `HISTORY_REPORTED`，这轮在当前仓库里核对过的才是 `CURRENT_OBSERVED`。Grok 只读看得见的 `updates.jsonl`。Pi 只跟当前这条分支。ZCode 只读 `cli/db/db.sqlite`，不回放调用、不复活进程。压缩只标成警告，库里仍在的更早记录会保留。废弃的 `v2/sessions` 和 `cli/rollout` JSONL 不是主存储；只有 sqlite 不在时，才对 `projects/` 下的 JSONL 做带警告的尽力读取。Qoder 只读 `QODER_CONFIG_DIR`（默认 `~/.qoder`，可用 `QODER_HOME` 兜底）`projects/<目录别名>/<会话>.jsonl` 转录，以及 Qoder IDE 的 `SharedClientCache/cli/projects` 平铺转录（可用 `QODER_IDE_CACHE_DIR` 覆盖）。加密的 `state.json`、`logs/sessions` 运行日志、`.auth` 凭据和 `settings.json` 一律不读；`isSidechain` 子代理记录和隐藏推理跳过并计警告。WorkBuddy 只读 `projects/<工作区>/<会话 id>.jsonl`（配置根目录按 `WORKBUDDY_CONFIG_DIR` → `CODEBUDDY_CONFIG_DIR` → `~/.workbuddy-ai`/`~/.workbuddy` 解析），不回放调用、不复活应用；隐藏推理、meta/compact/steer/teammate 记录和 quick-ask 草稿会话都会被跳过，`workbuddy.db` 只是索引、不读取。"
    },
    {
      "section": "命令",
      "text": "| 命令 | 从哪接着 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `/resume-codex [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | Codex CLI / 应用 |\n| `/resume-claude [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | Claude Code |\n| `/resume-cursor [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | Cursor |\n| `/resume-grok [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | Grok |\n| `/resume-pi [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | Pi |\n| `/resume-qoder [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | Qoder CLI / IDE |\n| `/resume-workbuddy [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | WorkBuddy |\n| `/resume-zcode [latest \\| 会话 id \\| 路径 \\| 标题]` | ZCode |"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\ncorepack pnpm install\npnpm check\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "Apache-2.0。见 [LICENSE](LICENSE) 和 [NOTICE](NOTICE)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-resume",
      "text": "[中文](README.md)\n\nBring local Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, Grok, Pi, Qoder, WorkBuddy, and ZCode session context into DeepSeek Harness to continue unfinished work."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "**Version 0.2.8 targets DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.5.** Both the package and repository contain compiled plugin files; no Harness source checkout or local build is required. Python 3 is required to read history. Compressed Codex rollouts additionally require `zstd`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Official Desktop app",
      "text": "1. Open **Plugins → Add plugin** (under Settings in some versions).\n2. Enter `github:aa2246740/dsh-resume#v0.2.8` in **Package name or address**, then install and enable it.\n3. Follow the installer's activation instructions. Type `/resume-` in the composer and check that all eight commands below appear."
    },
    {
      "section": "Official Desktop app",
      "text": "Alternatively, download `dsh-resume-0.2.8.tgz` from the [v0.2.8 Release](https://github.com/aa2246740/dsh-resume/releases/tag/v0.2.8) and enter its absolute path in the same installer. Desktop uses its own profile; do not use Web Host commands to install into Desktop."
    },
    {
      "section": "Web Host",
      "text": "Use the official CLI:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:aa2246740/dsh-resume#v0.2.8\n```\n\nOr, from the downloaded archive's directory:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add ./dsh-resume-0.2.8.tgz\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Web Host",
      "text": "The official `dsh` command and pnpm must be available. Node.js must be `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`. Use the existing Web Host's `DSH_HOME`. This only installs into the Web profile, not Desktop. Follow the official installer's activation result. If it requests a restart, exit and reopen the original Host normally; do not start another Host alongside it.\n\nThe npm package is `@aa2246740/dsh-resume`. Choose either the npm package or the GitHub package; do not install both."
    },
    {
      "section": "Upgrade and remove",
      "text": "Repeat the matching installation steps to upgrade. If migrating from a manual mount, disable the old duplicate entry and retain only the package's `dsh-resume` instance.\n\nRemove through the Desktop plugin manager, or for Web:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-resume\n```\n\nFor the npm package, use `@aa2246740/dsh-resume` as the package name instead."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "Type `/resume-claude`, or the matching command for the other seven. The plugin reads that local session, pulls context that can still be handed off, and writes a card into the current DSH chat. It does not restart the old process or rewrite anyone else's session files.\n\nThe six sections are objective, files, done, remaining, stopped at, and reader warnings. If a title is ambiguous it lists candidates instead of guessing."
    },
    {
      "section": "Commands",
      "text": "Read-only. Foreign session stores are not modified. System prompts, hidden reasoning, encrypted or corrupt records are dropped or marked unavailable. History conclusions start as `HISTORY_REPORTED`. Only facts checked in the current workspace this turn are `CURRENT_OBSERVED`. Grok reads visible `updates.jsonl` only. Pi follows the current branch only. ZCode reads `cli/db/db.sqlite` only and does not replay calls or revive the CLI. Compaction is a warning; older rows still in the database are kept. Abandoned `v2/sessions` and `cli/rollout` JSONL are not the primary store. Projects JSONL is a warned fallback only when sqlite is absent. Qoder reads the Claude-Code-shaped `projects/<dir-slug>/<session>.jsonl` transcripts under `QODER_CONFIG_DIR` (default `~/.qoder`, `QODER_HOME` accepted as a fallback alias) plus the IDE's flat `SharedClientCache/cli/projects` transcripts (overridable with `QODER_IDE_CACHE_DIR`). The encrypted `state.json` siblings, `logs/sessions` run logs, `.auth` credentials, and `settings.json` are never read; `isSidechain` subagent records and hidden reasoning are skipped with a warning. WorkBuddy reads `projects/<workspace>/<session id>.jsonl` only (config root r"
    },
    {
      "section": "Commands",
      "text": "| Command | Source |\n| --- | --- |\n| `/resume-codex [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | Codex CLI / app |\n| `/resume-claude [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | Claude Code |\n| `/resume-cursor [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | Cursor |\n| `/resume-grok [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | Grok |\n| `/resume-pi [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | Pi |\n| `/resume-qoder [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | Qoder CLI / IDE |\n| `/resume-workbuddy [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | WorkBuddy |\n| `/resume-zcode [latest \\| session id \\| path \\| title]` | ZCode |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Develop",
      "text": "```sh\ncorepack pnpm install\npnpm check\n```"
    },
